Error [E0113]: This value is `Unit`, but `old_open` returns Bool FileCryptoError!
  --> crypto_file_open_bool.jet:4:19
    |
  4 |     return crypto.file_open(identity, source, destination)
    |                   ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `old_open` declares Bool FileCryptoError! as its result, so the value it hands back must be Bool FileCryptoError!
 Fix: Hand back a Bool FileCryptoError! value: convert this value to Bool FileCryptoError!, or return the value you meant
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113
